br&gt;▫️尾门双应急拉手&lt;br&gt;▫️9个碰撞传感器&lt;br&gt;▫️低速慢行灯&lt;br&gt;▫️160km/h高速爆胎稳定控制&lt;br&gt;▫️支持涉水模式、应急浮水脱困&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9?type=0&quot;&gt;#今日热点#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B3%E6%BE%8E%E7%A8%8B?type=0&quot;&gt;#小米澎程#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6?type=0&quot;&gt;#汽车#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/d31f1c76ccf0a471a290ba9eab799dc5.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/210736c79a23cbd512b1856d20635045.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/d6bac4244dbb4f083bc96aedead29f48.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/bf81d6016f80a6c45027859d085991f0.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73631109</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73631109</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:01:20 GMT</pubDate><author>竹本青</author></item><item><title>〖小米澎程N70系列发布：20.99万元起〗 N70 Pro：20.99万元 N70 Max：23.99万元 ◇ 全系满配辅助驾驶 搭载700TOPS NVIDIA Thor芯片，全系标配小米HAD、25项安全...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;〖小米澎程N70系列发布：20.99万元起〗

