&gt;- 超广角丨5000万像素OV50M&lt;br&gt;1/2.88英寸丨17mm丨F2.4丨102°FOV&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 前置丨1600万像素&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 电池&amp;amp;充电&lt;br&gt;- 6000mAh小米金沙江电池&lt;br&gt;- 67W快充&lt;br&gt;- 50W无线充电&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 其他&lt;br&gt;- IP58 &amp;amp; IP59防尘防水&lt;br&gt;- Wi-Fi 7丨UWB&lt;br&gt;- 双1216H对称式立体声扬声器&lt;br&gt;- 超薄X轴线性马达&lt;br&gt;- 小米澎湃OS4&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9?type=0&quot;&gt;#今日热点#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B3%E7%A7%8B%E5%AD%A3%E6%97%97%E8%88%B0%E6%96%B0%E5%93%81%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%BC%9A?type=0&quot;&gt;#小米秋季旗舰新品发布会#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/1414e3d8dfb40c5a648589c91e2e3745.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/44399cdc181fc6c6ae543117e2a8e4f6.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/5bb759f1eea32ea43130a950b8db9e5a.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/ae05b64bc99fbde3341a08b24a9108f5.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/d2a3c33e4e86110329440a5ed75a0cb2.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/17f51ed611c0b0c7e52343c5d47baf2e.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/088b95cd044555ecc77a451badf8f238.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/3846c484b7ff1fb1cb90787490c62dc6.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/4e6aed119f67f4f03ed7ce2dcf8c79d9.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73629257</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73629257</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 11:38:32 GMT</pubDate><author>赛博帕鲁</author></item><item><title>来到发布会辣，吓哭了xdm，前面坐着卢总和曾总，扣1踹他们靠背 #小米澎程# #小米18Fold#</title><description>&lt;p&gt;来到发布会辣，吓哭了xdm，前面坐着卢总和曾总，扣1踹他们靠背 &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;ht